%% frame: UC5 basic flow 2: the deadline passes (analysis)
sequenceDiagram
    actor S as Scheduler
    participant X as SchedulerTrigger (boundary)
    participant R as ResolveTeamControl (control)
    participant T as Team (entity)
    participant O as Order (entity)

    S->>X: B5: tick(now)
    X->>R: B5: expireDue(now)
    R->>R: B6: selectDue(now)
    loop each due team, oldest deadline first
        R->>T: B7: expire(now)
        alt still open and deadline passed
            T->>T: B7: canMoveTo(EXPIRED)
            T-->>R: expired
            loop each pending order of the team
                R->>O: B8: cancel(at)
            end
            Note over R,O: B9: «extend» UC6 at resolved {team expired}: one refund obligation per paid member (@sec-a-uc06)
            Note over R,O: B10: the result is published for members (design only)
        else already resolved (A2)
            T-->>R: refused, skip this team
        end
    end
